OL,3,GNEWSAMan charged over multiple sex
OL,4,Aassaults at university
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 29-year-old man has appeared in court
OL,7,Fcharged with sexually assaulting seven
OL,8,Fwomen in and around the University of
OL,9,FHuddersfield.
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Police said officers
OL,12,Fwere called to the university on
OL,13,FTuesday evening following reports of a
OL,14,Fman approaching and sexually touching
OL,15,Fwomen.
OL,17,FAfter an investigation, the force said
OL,18,FSophan Akbash, from Huddersfield, had
OL,19,Fbeen charged with nine counts of sexual
OL,20,Fassault.
OL,23,APub: 13-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
